      "name": "dsh-notify-toast",
      "title": {
        "en": "Lightweight Native Notifications",
        "zh": "轻量原生通知"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Native Windows task-completion notifications for DSH: one clean toast when the agent finishes, with a session summary and the key point of the final reply—not an alert for every tool step. Lightweight and quiet, with a taskbar unread badge, configurable sounds, and no resident background service. MIT-licensed, actively maintained for DSH compatibility.",
        "zh": "DSH 任务完成通知：Agent 收尾时发一条 Windows 原生 Toast，带会话摘要与最后回复重点，不按每个工具步骤刷屏。轻量无常驻后台，聚焦不打扰，附任务栏未读角标、提示音与可配置提醒。MIT 开源，持续跟进 DSH 兼容。"
      },
      "icon": "icon.svg",
